            "review_text": "Voyage00217119127\n3 contributions\n0\nSurprising Thai vibe lunch in Thao Dien\nOct 2026 • Solo\nIt's hot outside, but as soon as you step into the restaurant, it's cool. \nCozy space, with a very unique style. \nI went alone for lunch so I chose the stir-fried squid lunch set with fragrant herbs. A serving enough for one person to eat until full. The squid stir-fry sauce is very delicious with rice. \nAlso, I saw the restaurant has a new skewered grilled meat set, I'll go back to try it next time.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten October 8, 2026\nMiminoita\nMuch appreciated your feedback. Glad you enjoyed our food. We looking forward to see you again next time ka 😇🙏\nWritten October 8, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
